      "description": "Santa's watching... now your children can see it!\n\nSanta's Nice-O-Meter brings a sprinkle of North Pole magic to the run-up to Christmas. Grown-ups secretly report kind and helpful moments to Santa. Children watch Santa's golden Nice-O-Meter rise, read personal letters from the North Pole, and follow Santa all the way to their home on Christmas Eve.\n\nREPORT TO SANTA\nSpotted some sharing, tidying or bravery? Tell Santa in a couple of taps, as yourself or as your family's elf. There are naughty reports too, for gentle reminders, but Santa is always kind.\n\nTHE NICE-O-METER\nEach child has their own antique gold meter from Santa's workshop, with Santa reacting as it rises.\n\nTHE CHRISTMAS LIST\nWrite a list for Santa together. Snap a photo of the present (from a catalogue or a shop) or pick a picture, then watch each wish fill up and land in Santa's sleigh as they're kind. Children can even add to their own list, and you get a reminder to set the sizes and order.\n\nLETTERS FROM SANTA\nWrite to Santa about your child, and his reply arrives a little later, with a spoken hello from Santa himself. Every letter is personal: it mentions your child, your elf and the good things they've done. Prefer to write Santa's reply yourself? You can.\n\nCHRISTMAS EVE SANTA TRACKER\nOn 24 December the app becomes a Santa Tracker, following Santa around the world to your own home. On Christmas morning, a special letter from Santa is waiting.\n\nMADE FOR FAMILIES\n- Works with your family's elf, or without one. Choose the day your elf arrives.\n- Brothers and sisters each get their own meter, list and letters.\n- The grown-ups' area is locked with a PIN.\n- Pay once. No adverts, no subscriptions, no in-app purchases.\n- No accounts. Your family's information stays on your phone.\n\nQuestions?\nWalkthrough video: https://youtu.be/QvpEuoRuhCY\nFAQs: https://solcari.co.uk/apps/nice-o-meter\nEmail: admin@solcari.co.uk",
